==Battleground==
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Luke (Enemy)|Luke]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[The Face]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use the Shy Boy at the beginning to stall and save up enough cash, then send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. Luke has high pierce and a short attack rate, so anything that outranges/tanks him and deals good damge will be a godsend. This includes [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Crimson Mina]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] if you have them. Be sure to bring [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] to deal with the Shy Boys!

